         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview: Added all scoring KPIs to the Review table, aligned guiding controls, and preserved window size when collapsing sections. Image selection now retains preview zoom and position. Guiding min/avg/max plots highlight Good/Medium/Bad ranges in arcseconds; the Guiding quality plot displays its formula without category bands. Updated documentation.
            </p>
